# Music Player — UIKit

A simple music player application built with Swift, UIKit, Storyboard, and AVAudioPlayer.

## Features

- Displays the track title, artist, and cover image.
- Plays and pauses audio.
- Switches to the next and previous tracks.
- Supports track navigation with wraparound.
- Automatically advances to the next track when playback finishes.
- Uses UIStackView and Auto Layout for a responsive interface.

## Technologies

- Swift
- UIKit
- Storyboard
- UIStackView
- Auto Layout
- AVFoundation

